      <para>Algebra 1 by OpenStax is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution License v4.0. Algebra 1 was authored by OpenStax and is based, in part, on OpenStax Prealgebra, Elementary Algebra, Intermediate Algebra, and College Algebra materials, and the IM 6–12 Math™ by Illustrative Mathematics®. </para>
      <para>
        <figure>
          <media alt="Insert Alt Text">
